[00:10.75]1. To whom do you belong?
[00:14.28]Which god do you now obey?
[00:17.81]Your master’s the one to whom you bow.
[00:21.34]He is your god; you serve him now.
[00:24.88]You cannot serve two gods;
[00:28.41]Devotion cannot be shared.
[00:31.94]And so in the end your choice will depend
[00:35.47]On how your heart is prepared.
[00:39.01]2. To whom do you belong?
[00:42.54]Which god will you now obey?
[00:46.07]For one god is false and one is true,
[00:49.60]So make your choice; it’s up to you.
[00:53.14]Will Caesar of this world
[00:56.67]Possess your allegiance still?
[01:00.20]Or will you obey the true God today
[01:03.73]By always doing his will?
[01:07.27]3. To whom do I belong?
[01:10.80]Jehovah I will obey.
[01:14.33]My Father in heaven I will serve;
[01:17.86]I’ll pay my vows without reserve.
[01:21.40]He bought me at great cost;
[01:24.93]Devoted to him I’ll stay.
[01:28.46]To him I will give each moment I live.
[01:31.99]His name I’ll honor each day.